WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:05.130
Photography becomes a paradox.
It feels factual, but it erases history.

2
00:00:05.780 --> 00:00:10.110
No hint of the debates happening in Congress,
no glimpse of Native newspapers,

3
00:00:10.360 --> 00:00:12.880
no sign of the complex
political strategies

4
00:00:12.900 --> 00:00:16.010
unfolding across the Great Plains
and the Southwest.

5
00:00:16.820 --> 00:00:20.690
The photograph freezes a person
in a moment that implies permanence.
